{"id":1020301,"chapter_id":1020301,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"闹哄哄的狄斯卡危机终于在你和黛伦嗷呜的协助下平息。身为MBCC的局长，你带着一队士兵，清理着狄莱坞，谨防那股“可怕的力量”躲在哪个角落里伺机而动。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"狄斯卡的主办方定了足足5个场馆来举办这场盛会，看着相连的几栋高大建筑，你叹了口气。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"看来，今晚要加班到半夜了。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"你活动活动酸痛的脖子，决定穿过那个被灰烬使徒砸出来的大洞，去后面的建筑再检查一番。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"？？？","content":"不好意思！！让一下！！","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"刚一踏入小巷，一阵杂乱的脚步声便朝你袭来。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"同时，还有一个熟悉的身影逐渐向你靠近。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"options":["黛伦？！"],"style":6,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301008,"trial_step":8,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"黛伦？！","goto":9}]},{"step":9,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"啊！是局长啊！","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"黛伦抓着飞走的帽子，一个箭步就冲了上来。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"你本以为她是过来和你打招呼，却不曾想她一把抓住你，带着你就往前跑去。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"好巧啊局长！在这里又遇见了你！","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"等、等一下！","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"你这是做什么？！","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"还未等到黛伦回答，你就听见身后传来一连串的声音：","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"老板A","content":"黛伦导演！不要跑！看看我们的新合同！保证让你满意！","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"老板B","content":"只要您愿意签我们！他们给多少钱我都翻倍！！","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"记者A","content":"黛伦导演！来谈谈你这次的出场到底有什么意图吧！还有您现在抓住的这个人，会是你下一部电影的主角吗？！","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"抱歉——我现在暂时没办法回答——！","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"记者B","content":"那黛伦导演手上的这位先生，您有什么想要对我们说的吗？！","female_content":"那黛伦导演手上的这位小姐，您有什么想要对我们说的吗？！","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_9","vo_trial_20301_1_9f"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"我……我……","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"一边跑一边面对这些人的追问，你根本不知道要怎么样回答。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"电光火石间，你看到了不远处的一堆废墟——那是之前你们和灰烬使徒周旋的地方。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"你加速超过黛伦，反变成你拉着她，躲进了那栋已经废弃的大楼里。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"呼、呼、呼……","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"解释一下吧……黛伦大导演。","style":2,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"嘿嘿……我本来、本来也挺有名气的吧。","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"这不是，狄斯卡最后没举办成功吗，但这些人，总得弄些啥交差嘛……结果都来争着抢着要跟我谈合同做采访……","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"真不知道他们怎么进化的，我跑到哪里都能找到我……","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"黛伦揉了揉脖子，脸上挂着颇为无奈的表情。","style":3,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"options":["我有个办法，能让他们找不到你。"],"style":6,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301031,"trial_step":31,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我有个办法，能让他们找不到你。","goto":32}]},{"step":32,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"嗯？你有什么办法？","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"跟我来。","style":2,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"啊？你这是要带我去哪里啊？","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"跟我来就是了。","style":2,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1102033},{"step":37,"content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1102033},{"step":38,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"这就是你说的……办法？","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1102033},{"step":39,"content":"MBCC是机密场所，没有我以及我上级的允许，普通人是无法进来的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1102033},{"step":40,"content":"不仅他们找不到你，你在这里还可以得到保护以及收容，我认为是个两全其美的办法。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1102033},{"step":41,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"哈，简单来说就是包吃包住呗？","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1102031},{"step":42,"content":"……可以这么说。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1102031},{"step":43,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"那挺好的。","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1102030},{"step":44,"content":"见得到了你的肯定回答，黛伦往后一仰，极为放松地坐在审查室的椅子上，微笑着看着你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1102030},{"step":45,"content":"你……不挣扎一下吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1102030},{"step":46,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"挣扎？挣扎什么……","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1102030},{"step":47,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"我是禁闭者，你是MBCC的局长，按理来说，我本来就是要进这个地方吧。","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1102030},{"step":48,"content":"是这样没错。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1102030},{"step":49,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"而且这里包吃包住，不用日晒雨淋，还不怕被那些家伙找到。","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1102032},{"step":50,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"何乐而不为呢局长，对吧。","voice":["vo_trial_20301_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120301052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1102032},{"step":51,"content":"看着眼前一脸轻